          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: On the night of November 16 to 17, 1993, around 00:45, a witness observed a fixed bright light in the sky \"like a neon tube\" around which a number of glowing points were circling. This phenomenon was accompanied by a faint noise reminiscent of a small plane. The witness woke up his companion who was also able to observe the phenomenon. Despite a newspaper article, no other information could be gathered.",
